@startuml gpu_readiness
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title GPU learning readiness - required, not qualified
start
:Retain operator-reported 8 GB GPU / host currently uses it;
:Keep active GPU attached; shared host Docker GPU design selected;
if (Actual GPU/vendor/runtime prerequisites identified?) then (no)
  :trainingReady=false; no CPU fallback or active GPU rebind;
  stop
else (yes)
  :Select GPU/backend/driver and immutable runtime inputs;
endif
:Executor accepts complete Gate0 design and prerequisites;
:Obtain separate exact capture/build/qualification grants;
:Admit host-backed state, CPU/RAM/VRAM and original clocks;
:Qualify actual-target F64 scoring, autodiff, SGD and record reload;
:Verify redundant learners, numerical checks and owned cleanup;
if (GPU evidence and every existing Gate0/F9/R4 check accepted?) then (no)
  :trainingReady=false; preserve failures without retry/reset;
  stop
else (yes)
  :Technical readiness only; training execution still needs its own grant;
endif
stop
@enduml
